{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":8,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"4a8d9bc4-a101-44b3-b0f7-87503a53b57a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151196507,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"生态发展岗","OrgId":3089393,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"主要职责：\n1.生态对接：对接负责区域内上下游厂商（包括芯片、OS、整机、ISV）、研究公司业务与各类生态伙伴的合作价值，尤其是区域内的ISV合作伙伴，协同销售或主动拉起生态合作，推动迁移适配。\n2.重要ISV对接：通过公司发布重要ISV及其业务场景，联系ISV当地人员，对接并挖掘商机，与一线销售配合实现项目落地。\n3、区域ISV开拓：进行区域市场调研，筛选并挖掘具备复制推广价值的ISV和应用场景，对接伙伴，建设区域生态，并挖掘商机，打通商务环节，辅助一线销售进行市场开拓。\n4、业务场景复制与推广：结合重点ISV和区域ISV的开拓情况，制定ISV复制推广计划，赋能全体销售补充商机水库、增加签单。\n5.生态合作达成：开展ISV业务拓展，与其总部沟通并签订ESL或战略合作协议，增加业绩产出。\n6.价值ISV适配：跟进价值ISV，统筹公司资源，协同销售攻坚伙伴关系，推动完成适配；\n7.完成上级领导交代的其他生态相关工作；","Require":"1. 本科以上学历，专业不限，计算机、软件、市场营销等相关优先；\n2.有市场拓展和客户方、集成商、渠道方沟通基础，具备与合作伙伴中高层对接及构建良好合作关系、close订单的能力；\n3.具备至少2年销售工作经验，有信创厂商工作经历优先，要了解生态合作的工作逻辑和价值；\n4.勤奋、踏实、有目标感，每年可以完成自己的任务目标。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-26T16:10:48","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":f