策划落地课程共建、联合实验室等高校合作项目，培育开源人才；统筹行业高端会议与技术活动，提升瀚高在开源领域的行业影响力。\n\n平台实力：\n首家：基础软件领域首家荣获中国质量奖提名奖，浪潮集团战略投资的国有数据库软件企业。\n10+：深耕数据库内核研发十余年，是中央政府采购网、中共中央直属机关采购中心指定数据库软件供应商。\n300+：服务网点遍布全国30余个中心城市，拥有全国近300家服务合作伙伴，100余研发成员一线支持。\n200000+：产品广泛应用于电子政府、公共服务、地理信息等关键核心领域，数十万套HighGoDB部署。\n其他：\n——全面的能力培养体系+更快的晋升速度与晋升机会\n——数据库领军品牌平台+高素质伙伴与客户的共事机会\n——周末双休+法定节假日；\n——试用期缴纳五险一金，每年提供涨薪机会；\n——极客氛围，导师一对一带教；\n——节日福利，团建活动，带薪年假应有尽有","Require":"任职要求：\n1-本科及以上学历优先，5-8年B2B市场营销或品牌管理经验，其中至少2年从事开源生态建设、开发者关系或技术社区运营相关工作。\n2-有数据库、基础软件、云计算、IT基础设施等行业背景者优先；有PostgreSQL或相关开源数据库生态工作经验者优先。\n3- 具备高校合作、产学研项目落地经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-26T10:37:53","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"667873b3-2a72-4d15-bc35-1dbaad7bf6a3","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151194444,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"行业销售","OrgId":2991833,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"【工作内容】：\n1、销售任务承接与执行\n（1）持续关注行业动态、市场趋